  "notes": "Marriage registered in Malmo, Sweden. Both vaccinated and baptised. Emigrated to Canada (brought by Borje Hagborg) July 25 1902(Montreal) on Cunard line ship S.S. Lusitania later torpedoed and sunk during World War I Have picture before left Sweden  Married Kristina Hansdotter 06/11/1868  Registered in Vesterstade congregation, Malmohus.  Church certificate signed by K.S. Forsberg, Pastor 07/10/1902",
